      "title": "Add DECT NR+ MAC layer",
      "message": "Add DECT NR+ MAC layer\n\nDECT NR+ is specified in ETSI TS 103 636.\n\nA preference is available to configure the Physical Header Field\ntype (40 bits or 80 bits) if the trace does not follow the spec\ndefined for WTAP_ENCAP_DECT_NR.\n\nA preference is available to configure DLC PDU data type. The\ndefault Automatic configuration will use heuristics to detect IPv6.\n\nThe specification uses different field lengths based on the value\nof µ (subcarrier scaling factor). This is handled here by checking\nthe expected length for a message or IE.\n\nThe use of CVG Protocol Data Units is not implemented.\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit 3d66db02b9987152202c0ed3fe910e5d6edd1a09)\n\nCo-authored-by: Stig Bjørlykke <stig@bjorlykke.org>",
      "author_name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
